<title>UK: IOC may post year loss, cites fewer orders.</title>
<headline>IOC may post year loss, cites fewer orders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British electronic components maker IOC International Plc said on Tuesday it may post a loss for the year due to a cutback in purchases by its largest customer.</p>
</text>
